# LIFE-129: once a night at 2:30 AM Central, with up to 10 minutes of random delay. Persistent: a night the machine was down runs when it comes back.
[Unit]
Description=LIFE OS off-site backup, nightly

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 02:30:00 America/Chicago
RandomizedDelaySec=600
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
